{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You are an angler haunted by huge debts. In the midst of yet another night working at sea, you catch something different: a fish which talks, and promises to make you rich... but at what cost?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Short shocking horror</strong>. A brief (around 30 minutes) fishing horror game about debt and hopelessness. Enjoy a twisted cautionary tale in one sitting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Underwater eye-cam</strong>. Watch the fish biting the lure, then retrieve it as fast as you can. Be careful though: something else may be watching you as well...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fish and gut</strong>. Fly-fish like a pro, then gut your catch to keep 'em fresh. Be careful with the knife though: you don't want to cut yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The talking fish wants a deal</strong>. Consider the alluring promises of this mysterious being through surreal dialogues and twisted choices.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The loan shark is coming</strong>. This is no relaxing cozy fishing experience. Your time is running out, and something horrible lurks in the water.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3751730?t=1748422765","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3751730?t=1748422765","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/02a96a3dab95e5187e35c740600ad7bc82e8aa51/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748422765","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3